# --- Real-audio evaluation artefacts: never committed ---
# Xeno-canto audio carries per-recording Creative Commons terms that vary by
# recording, so no audio is redistributed here. The dataset is rebuilt locally
# from data/ by scripts/build_dataset.py; only its provenance (DATA_SOURCES.md)
# and the measured results (docs/real_eval_results.json) are committed.
data/
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.ogg
*.npy

# BirdNET / TFLite model weights and any downloaded model cache: never committed.
models/
*.tflite
.birdnet/
checkpoints/

# Credentials: the Xeno-canto API key and any token must never be committed.
*key*.txt
*.env
.env
secrets*.md

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.so

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
